/www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1796022/000162828026005769/0001628280-26-005769-index.htm","accession":"0001628280-26-005769"},{"text":"Shareholders' equity is negative (-$413.6m) - liabilities exceed assets on the balance sheet.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1796022/000162828026038446/0001628280-26-038446-index.htm","accession":"0001628280-26-038446"},{"text":"Insiders disposed of 23.7% of their combined holdings over the last four quarters (202,290 shares across 14 ownership filings). People with the best view of the business were reducing their stake.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1796022/000182288026000004/0001822880-26-000004-index.htm"},{"text":"Officers and directors hold only 0.8% of the shares. There is little alignment between what happens to the share price and what happens to them.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1796022/000182288026000004/0001822880-26-000004-index.htm"},{"text":"Base rate: 57.8% of US common stocks underperformed one-month Treasury bills over their lifetimes (Bessembinder, Journal of Financial Economics, 2018). Nothing above changes that starting point.","source_url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jfineco.2018.06.004"}],"triggers":[{"id":"growth_floor","kind":"metric","label":"Revenue growth falls below 37.0% for 2 consecutive quarters","metric":"revenue_growth_yoy","comparison":"below","threshold":0.37,"consecutive":2,"current":0.73,"current_display":"73.0%","threshold_display":"37.0%","fired":false,"rationale":"If growth halves and stays there, the reason you looked at this company has gone.","editable":true},{"id":"dilution_ceiling","kind":"metric","label":"Diluted share count growth rises above 15.0%","metric":"dilution_yoy","comparison":"above","threshold":0.15,"consecutive":1,"current":0.078,"current_display":"7.8%","threshold_display":"15.0%","fired":false,"rationale":"Share count growth above this rate transfers your stake to new holders faster than the busin